# SmartMetric project-specific ignore rules
# Syntax is close to .gitignore for common cases:
# - blank lines and # comments are ignored
# - plain names target directories
# - wildcards and paths act like glob rules
# - ! can re-include a previously ignored path

coverage
tmp
temp
*.generated.*
*.min.js
*.map
!/docs/keep.md

docs/
agents/
samples/
tests/
